===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{countable|uncountable}} Act of [[expending]] or [[paying]] out.
# An [[amount]] [[expended]]; an [[expense]]; an outlay.
#: ''The '''expenditure''' of time, money, and political capital on this project has been excessive.''

